Here's an example of how you can create a responsive navigation bar with the specified features using HTML and CSS:

HTML:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">
      <a href="#">Logo</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li class="active"><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li class="dropdown">
        <a href="#products">Products</a>
