```

JavaScript (script.js):
```javascript
const navSlide = () => {
  const burger = document.querySelector('.burger');
  const nav = document.querySelector('.nav-links');

  burger.addEventListener('click', () => {
    nav.classList.toggle('show-nav');
  });
}

navSlide();
```

This code will create a responsive navigation bar with smooth scrolling functionality and the specified features. The navigation bar will have a fixed position at the top of the page and will collapse into a burger menu icon when viewed on smaller screens. The "Home" link will be highlighted as the current page. The "Products" and "Services" links will have dropdown menus that expand when hovered over.

